  "extra_findings": [
    "F6: the CSV export writes a fixed shared file EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv (race between concurrent exports, possible exposure under the docroot, blank HTTP 200 when fopen fails), lib.php:125-150; this finding also carries BUG-004",
    "F10: array-shaped GET/POST params (busca[]=, login[]=) trigger a TypeError/500, index.php:22,72-73",
    "F11: no login rate limiting or failed-login logging, index.php:20-29 (only logging added)",
    "F12: formatarStatus maps any status outside 1-3 to 'Resolvido', lib.php:32-34 (latent; deliberately left unchanged)",
    "F14: concatenated SQL in verChamado/tecnicoNome, lib.php:69,100. Reported as hardening, not exploitable (int-typed)",
    "F15: the mysqli connection-failure check is dead on PHP >= 8.1 (exception is thrown before connect_errno), index.php:9-12",
    "F17: no pagination, and the leading-wildcard LIKE forces a full scan, lib.php:80-84. The report explicitly says an index cannot help, so this is not the PERF-006 decoy"
  ],
